EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi {!Lead.FirstName},

I'll keep this short and sweet to make the 21 seconds it takes to read it worth your time (yes, I actually timed it.) 

We’re running a special deposit match for advisors in NY and NJ who are interested in giving our new life insurance referrals a try.

Enroll before March 9th, 2018 and we will match your initial deposit up to $2,000. So, if you set-up an EverQuote Pro account and put down any amount between $250 and $2,000 we’ll match and double it.

And we won’t lock you into any minimum term commitment - clients stay on with EverQuote because they see ROI. 

Can we set-up a quick conversation this week? Or you can reach me directly via email or @ {!User.Phone} ?

Cheers,
{!User.FirstName} 

{!User.Name} 
Inside Sales Representative 
{!User.Phone} 
{!User.Email}
